    },
    {
        "scene_index": 20,
        "start_timecode": "00:02:11.040",
        "end_timecode": "00:02:14.400",
        "audio_speech": "",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 21,
        "start_timecode": "00:02:14.400",
        "end_timecode": "00:02:40.640",
        "audio_speech": "Well, for Argentina, Paulo Dybala came off the bench with this kick of the ball in mind. Dybala down the middle. Some can barely walk. Mbappé. Some can barely watch. Yeah.",
        "audio_natural": "speech (conf=0.72)"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 22,
        "start_timecode": "00:02:40.640",
        "end_timecode": "00:02:43.040",
        "audio_speech": "Not easy when you've only been on the pitch a few minutes.",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 23,
        "start_timecode": "00:02:43.040",
        "end_timecode": "00:02:54.880",
        "audio_speech": "As he has. Not an easy situation, that. Martin Mouth, perhaps, hitting it down the middle.",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 24,
        "start_timecode": "00:02:54.880",
        "end_timecode": "00:02:57.920",
        "audio_speech": "",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 25,
        "start_timecode": "00:02:57.920",
        "end_timecode": "00:03:05.600",
        "audio_speech": "Meridian. Charmini has scored one of the goals of this competition against England in the quarterfinals.",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 26,
        "start_timecode": "00:03:05.600",
        "end_timecode": "00:03:08.800",
        "audio_speech": "Martinez is trying to get in his head.",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 27,
        "start_timecode": "00:03:08.800",
        "end_timecode": "00:03:11.360",
        "audio_speech": "He hasn't helped with the return of the ball.",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 28,
        "start_timecode": "00:03:11.360",
        "end_timecode": "00:03:16.640",
        "audio_speech": "He will do what it takes.",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 29,
        "start_timecode": "00:03:16.640",
        "end_timecode": "00:03:21.920",
        "audio_speech": "",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 30,
        "start_timecode": "00:03:21.920",
        "end_timecode": "00:03:32.640",
        "audio_speech": "Not a nail left to be chewed. Yes. Suomenia strikes it wide.",
        "audio_natural": "speech (conf=0.61), fixed-wing aircraft, airplane (conf=0.39)"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 31,
        "start_timecode": "00:03:32.640",
        "end_timecode": "00:03:37.120",
        "audio_speech": "Suomenia strikes it wide.",
        "audio_natural": "speech (conf=0.72)"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 32,
        "start_timecode": "00:03:37.120",
        "end_timecode": "00:03:40.480",
        "audio_speech": "And Argentina are on the cusp.",
        "audio_natural": "speech (conf=0.58)"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 33,
        "start_timecode": "00:03:40.480",
        "end_timecode": "00:03:45.440",
        "audio_speech": "",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 34,
        "start_timecode": "00:03:45.440",
        "end_timecode": "00:03:48.960",
        "audio_speech": "Easy to say now, but never looked entirely confident waiting for that.",
        "audio_natural": "speech (conf=0.83)"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 35,
        "start_timecode": "00:03:48.960",
        "end_timecode": "00:03:51.200",
        "audio_speech": "Easy to say now, but never looked entirely confident waiting for that.",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 36,
        "start_timecode": "00:03:51.200",
        "end_timecode": "00:03:55.200",
        "audio_speech": "He thrives on these situations, Martinez.",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 37,
        "start_timecode": "00:03:55.200",
        "end_timecode": "00:04:00.000",
        "audio_speech": "He really does.",
        "audio_natural": "speech (conf=0.33)"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 38,
        "start_timecode": "00:04:00.000",
        "end_timecode": "00:04:04.640",
        "audio_speech": "Paredes to take Argentina to match point.",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 39,
        "start_timecode": "00:04:04.640",
        "end_timecode": "00:04:08.320",
        "audio_speech": "",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 40,
        "start_timecode": "00:04:08.320",
        "end_timecode": "00:04:17.920",
        "audio_speech": "Fern.",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 41,
        "start_timecode": "00:04:17.920",
        "end_timecode": "00:04:20.480",
        "audio_speech": "No. Trelling. Nearly there.",
        "audio_natural": "speech (conf=0.63)"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 42,
        "start_timecode": "00:04:20.480",
        "end_timecode": "00:04:29.440",
        "audio_speech": "So very nearly there. Gets a touch on it. Ugo Lloris.",
        "audio_natural": "speech (conf=0.61)"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 43,
        "start_timecode": "00:04:29.440",
        "end_timecode": "00:04:31.840",
        "audio_speech": "",
        "audio_natural": "speech (conf=0.57)"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 44,
        "start_timecode": "00:04:31.840",
        "end_timecode": "00:04:35.840",
        "audio_speech": "Almost under his body, under the outstretched palm.",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 45,
        "start_timecode": "00:04:35.840",
        "end_timecode": "00:04:46.080",
        "audio_speech": "And France's margin for error is now zero.",
        "audio_natural": "vehicle (conf=0.32)"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 46,
        "start_timecode": "00:04:46.080",
        "end_timecode": "00:04:51.040",
        "audio_speech": "Here we go. He's trying everything there. Martinez trying to have a word.",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 47,
        "start_timecode": "00:04:51.040",
        "end_timecode": "00:04:59.840",
        "audio_speech": "Martinez trying to have a word with his man. Left pushing him back. Is this Colin Mwane? Yes, it is.",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 48,
        "start_timecode": "00:04:59.840",
        "end_timecode": "00:05:07.360",
        "audio_speech": "Nowhere to hide. He must. He has.",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 49,
        "start_timecode": "00:05:07.360",
        "end_timecode": "00:05:16.000",
        "audio_speech": "If in doubt, put your foot through it.",
        "audio_natural": "speech (conf=0.43)"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 50,
        "start_timecode": "00:05:16.000",
        "end_timecode": "00:05:19.200",
        "audio_speech": "",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 51,
        "start_timecode": "00:05:19.200",
        "end_timecode": "00:05:28.960",
        "audio_speech": "A long. Lonely walk. For Gonzalo Montiel.",
        "audio_natural": "speech (conf=0.43)"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 52,
        "start_timecode": "00:05:28.960",
        "end_timecode": "00:05:34.080",
        "audio_speech": "For Gonzalo Montiel. Didn't start the game.",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 53,
        "start_timecode": "00:05:34.080",
        "end_timecode": "00:05:40.320",
        "audio_speech": "He can finish it.",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 54,
        "start_timecode": "00:05:40.320",
        "end_timecode": "00:05:47.520",
        "audio_speech": "",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 55,
        "start_timecode": "00:05:47.520",
        "end_timecode": "00:05:53.600",
        "audio_speech": "Montiel.",
        "audio_natural": "none"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 56,
        "start_timecode": "00:05:53.600",
        "end_timecode": "00:05:57.280",
        "audio_speech": "Argentina. Champions of the world.",
        "audio_natural": "speech (conf=0.64)"
    },
    {
        "scene_index": 57,
        "start_timecode": "00:05:57.280",
        "end_timecode": "00:06:06.400",
        "audio_speech": "Again. At last. And a nation will tango all night long.",
        "audio_natural": "speech (conf=0.78)"
